1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
向设计师介绍白瓷的文化内涵
Introduce the cultural meaning of Blanc de Chine to a designer

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
用户用英文提问，系统开始作答
The user asks in English, and the system starts answering

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,500
它与景德镇的白瓷有什么不同？
How is it different from the white porcelain made in Jingdezhen?

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
它在对比两种白瓷的胎釉与气质
It compares the two white porcelains' body, glaze, and character

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,500
这张图片里的色彩和器物，背后有什么文化故事？
What cultural stories lie behind the colors and objects in this image?

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,000
用户上传白瓷图片，系统读图作答
The user uploads a photo, and the system reads the image

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
基于上面的白瓷故事，写一段三场景视频脚本，并附文生视频模型的提示词
Based on the Blanc de Chine story above, write a 3-scene video script with prompts for a text-to-video model

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,500
它把故事改写成了可直接生成的分镜脚本
It turns the story into a ready-to-shoot video script

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:32,500
用一段话向年轻人讲讲，为什么白瓷值得他们停下来看一眼
Tell young people, in one paragraph, why Blanc de Chine deserves a second look

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,000
切回中文提问，系统继续组织语言作答
Back to Chinese — the system keeps answering fluently

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,500
给我讲讲白瓷的故事，以及它对欧洲的影响
Raconte-moi l'histoire du Blanc de Chine et son influence en Europe

12
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:44,000
它切换成法语，自动跟随提问的语言作答
It switches to French, following the question's language automatically
